WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:18.500
Mr. Brown: Okay, everyone, close your books and go outside for recess.

2
00:00:18.515 --> 00:00:21.200
All: Whoo-hoo!

3
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.540
Brian: Let's play Peter Pan and Captain Hook.

4
00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:30.440
Brenda: Okay, I get to be Tinker Bell.

5
00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.480
Veronica: That's a dumb game.

6
00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:34.300
Veronica: You guys play.

7
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.100
Veronica: I'm going to watch.

8
00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:42.600
Brian: Okay, Brenda. Then I am Captain Hook.

9
00:00:42.637 --> 00:00:45.043
Brian: You're captured, Tinker Bell.

10
00:00:45.043 --> 00:00:46.560
Ricky: I'm Peter Pan.

11
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.880
Ricky: Everyone, get on board Captain Hook's ship.

12
00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:58.302
Brenda: Save me, Peter Pan!

13
00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:01.090
Brenda: Captain Hook has locked me in his ship.

14
00:01:03.378 --> 00:01:08.042
Ricky: Don't worry, Tinker Bell! I'll save you!

15
00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:10.340
Brian: I don't think so, Peter Pan.

16
00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:13.220
Brian: This time there is no escape.

17
00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:20.000
Brian: Peter Pan! Today, you will lose!

18
00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:26.030
Ricky: I'll never lose to you, Captain Hook!

19
00:01:26.121 --> 00:01:30.751
Ricky: And I'll save Tinker Bell.

20
00:01:30.751 --> 00:01:35.200
Brian: Nooooo! I'll get you, Peter Pan!

21
00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:39.690
Ricky: Come on, Tinker Bell. Let's get out of here!

22
00:01:40.690 --> 00:01:43.270
Brenda: Peter Pan, you're my hero!

23
00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:48.270
Ricky: Okay, okay, Brenda. The game is over.

24
00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:50.410
Ricky: Brian, are you hurt?

25
00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:55.740
Brian: I'm fine. This sand is comfortable.

26
00:01:56.341 --> 00:02:02.190
Brenda: Come on, you guys. Recess is over.

27
00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:08.018
Ricky: I'm Captain Hook next recess.
